hint_past_hole
--------------

l1: $ P _obj /\ (Q \/ R) $ by and_intro [pc [], or_l [q []]]
l2: $ P c /\ (Q \/ R) $ by and_intro [pc [], or_l [q []]]

repeated_hole_first
-------------------

l1: $ eq (f _obj) (f c) $ by refl []
l2: $ eq (f c) (f c) $ by refl []

repeated_hole_last
------------------

l1: $ eq (f c) (f _obj) $ by refl []
l2: $ eq (f c) (f c) $ by refl []

premise_fixes
-------------

l1: $ Q \/ P _obj $ by or_r [pc []]
l2: $ Q \/ P c $ by or_r [pc []]
